Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:41:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 366/402] Drawing PDF: --check-layout warns of what is out of
 the frame or on the title block

A note centred on its X ran out to the left of the frame and onto the
title block on the right, and nothing said so (company test 0.7.9). The
drawn extent of each view, text and dimension is taken from the page's
scene and compared with the sheet's frame and title block (named in the
ISO templates; else the largest rectangle and the editable texts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
